Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(contour): say the helix stand-down and the tabbed
 graze separately

The wall-side helix note and the graze refusal shared one flag. After the
first helix ramp, a later tabbed level grazed without a note. Track the two
in separate flags and say each once.

Refs #3829

